  "segments": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "start": 2.83,
      "end": 3.79,
      "en": "Hello English learners.",
      "zh": "各位英语学习者，大家好。"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "start": 4.24,
      "end": 5.35,
      "en": "Welcome back to EnglishPod.",
      "zh": "欢迎回到 EnglishPod。"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "start": 5.68,
      "end": 6.19,
      "en": "My name is Marco.",
      "zh": "我叫 Marco。"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "start": 6.55,
      "end": 7.33,
      "en": "And I'm Erica.",
      "zh": "我叫 Erica。"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "start": 7.85,
      "end": 12.05,
      "en": "And today we're bringing you our great suspense, scary series.",
      "zh": "今天，我们为您带来我们伟大的悬念、恐怖系列。"
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "start": 12.17,
      "end": 12.67,
      "en": "Our thriller.",
      "zh": "我们的惊悚片。"
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "start": 13.28,
      "end": 15.88,
      "en": "Our thriller, New Guy in Town, part four.",
      "zh": "我们的惊悚片，城里的新人，第四部分。"
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "start": 16.23,
      "end": 16.45,
      "en": "All right.",
      "zh": "好的。"
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "start": 16.88,
      "end": 20.85,
      "en": "Well, I don't want to give you any hints about what will happen in this dialogue.",
      "zh": "好吧，我不想给你任何关于这次对话会发生什么的提示。"
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "start": 21.29,
      "end": 22.55,
      "en": "Yes, it's totally unexpected.",
      "zh": "是的，这完全出乎意料。"
    },
    {
      "id": 11,
      "start": 23.29,
      "end": 28.19,
      "en": "So let's listen to our dialogue and then we'll come back and talk about some of the great vocabulary.",
      "zh": "所以让我们听听我们的对话，然后我们会回来谈论一些伟大的词汇。"
    },
    {
      "id": 12,
      "start": 38.04,
      "end": 39.04,
      "en": "All right.",
      "zh": "好的。"
    },
    {
      "id": 13,
      "start": 39.04,
      "end": 41.63,
      "en": "Drag her over here and help me tie her up.",
      "zh": "把她拖过来，帮我把她绑上。"
    },
    {
      "id": 14,
      "start": 43.6,
      "end": 45.06,
      "en": "I can't believe she fell for it.",
      "zh": "没想到她真上当了。"
    },
    {
      "id": 15,
      "start": 45.78,
      "end": 47.82,
      "en": "She is a lot more gullible than I thought.",
      "zh": "她比我想象的还容易骗。"
    },
    {
      "id": 16,
      "start": 48.12,
      "end": 52.08,
      "en": "Well, you got to admit my acting was brilliant.",
      "zh": "你得承认，我演得太精彩了。"
    },
    {
      "id": 17,
      "start": 52.08,
      "end": 52.31,
      "en": "Whatever.",
      "zh": "随便吧。"
    },
    {
      "id": 18,
      "start": 53.48,
      "end": 55.11,
      "en": "I was the one that convinced her to come.",
      "zh": "我是说服她来的人。"
    },
    {
      "id": 19,
      "start": 56.6,
      "end": 57.97,
      "en": "Look, she's waking up.",
      "zh": "看，她醒过来了。"
    },
    {
      "id": 20,
      "start": 60.52,
      "end": 61.52,
      "en": "What's going on, Ellen?",
      "zh": "艾伦，这是怎么回事？"
    },
    {
      "id": 21,
      "start": 61.52,
      "end": 62.52,
      "en": "What are you doing?",
      "zh": "你在做什么？"
    },
    {
      "id": 22,
      "start": 62.52,
      "end": 67.0,
      "en": "The cat's out of the bag, you witch.",
      "zh": "事情已经败露了，你这个女巫。"
    },
    {
      "id": 23,
      "start": 67.0,
      "end": 67.95,
      "en": "You can stop pretending now.",
      "zh": "别再装了。"
    },
    {
      "id": 24,
      "start": 68.44,
      "end": 70.57,
      "en": "Yeah, Lois, we know who you are.",
      "zh": "是的，露易丝，我们知道你是谁。"
    },
    {
      "id": 25,
      "start": 71.2,
      "end": 72.29,
      "en": "Now we want some answers.",
      "zh": "现在我们要你说清楚。"
    },
    {
      "id": 26,
      "start": 73.32,
      "end": 73.87,
      "en": "Why are you here?",
      "zh": "你为什么在这里？"
    },
    {
      "id": 27,
      "start": 90.91,
      "end": 92.27,
      "en": "You don't know who you're dealing with.",
      "zh": "你不知道你在和谁打交道。"
    },
    {
      "id": 28,
      "start": 95.32,
      "end": 96.32,
      "en": "You can't stop me.",
      "zh": "你阻止不了我。"
    },
    {
      "id": 29,
      "start": 114.57,
      "end": 116.91,
      "en": "Well, I certainly didn't see that one coming.",
      "zh": "好吧，我当然没有看到那一辆的到来。"
    },
    {
      "id": 30,
      "start": 117.31,
      "end": 119.93,
      "en": "I know everyone thought that Armand was a vampire.",
      "zh": "我知道每个人都认为阿曼德是吸血鬼。"
    },
    {
      "id": 31,
      "start": 120.52,
      "end": 120.95,
      "en": "I know.",
      "zh": "我知道。"
    },
    {
      "id": 32,
      "start": 121.52,
      "end": 123.96,
      "en": "And now it turns out that they were acting.",
      "zh": "而现在事实证明，他们是在演戏。"
    },
    {
      "id": 33,
      "start": 124.05,
      "end": 124.73,
      "en": "Yeah, crazy.",
      "zh": "是的，疯了。"
    },
    {
      "id": 34,
      "start": 125.43,
      "end": 125.87,
      "en": "Crazy, huh?",
      "zh": "疯了吧？"
    },
    {
      "id": 35,
      "start": 125.96,
      "end": 126.96,
      "en": "Yeah.",
      "zh": "对。"
    },
    {
      "id": 36,
      "start": 126.96,
      "end": 127.85,
      "en": "Strange things happen here on EnglishPod.",
      "zh": "Englishpod 上发生了奇怪的事情。"
    },
    {
      "id": 37,
      "start": 128.35,
      "end": 133.09,
      "en": "All right, so why don't we take a look at some of the language that we saw in Language Takeaway.",
      "zh": "好吧，那么我们为什么不看看我们在外卖中看到的一些语言。"
    },
    {
      "id": 38,
      "start": 134.91,
      "end": 136.11,
      "en": "Language Takeaway.",
      "zh": "语言要点。"
    },
    {
      "id": 39,
      "start": 137.52,
      "end": 141.28,
      "en": "Well, we have three words for you here that we heard in the dialogue.",
      "zh": "好吧，我们在对话中听到了三个字给你。"
    },
    {
      "id": 40,
      "start": 142.56,
      "end": 148.4,
      "en": "And the first one, Armand tells Ellen to drag her over here.",
      "zh": "第一个，阿曼德让艾伦把她拖到这里来。"
    },
    {
      "id": 41,
      "start": 149.08,
      "end": 149.68,
      "en": "Right, drag.",
      "zh": "对了，拖拉。"
    },
    {
      "id": 42,
      "start": 150.72,
      "end": 151.72,
      "en": "Drag.",
      "zh": "拖动。"
    },
    {
      "id": 43,
      "start": 151.72,
      "end": 153.92,
      "en": "So when you drag something or somebody.",
      "zh": "所以当你拖动某物或某人时。"
    },
    {
      "id": 44,
      "start": 154.56,
      "end": 158.3,
      "en": "You pull them across the floor or pull them across the ground.",
      "zh": "你把它们拉到地板上或把它们拉过地面。"
    },
    {
      "id": 45,
      "start": 158.72,
      "end": 160.72,
      "en": "Pull them, but you don't actually pick them up, right?",
      "zh": "拉它们，但你实际上并没有把它们捡起来，对吧？"
    },
    {
      "id": 46,
      "start": 161.32,
      "end": 162.32,
      "en": "No.",
      "zh": "不。"
    },
    {
      "id": 47,
      "start": 162.32,
      "end": 163.32,
      "en": "Yeah.",
      "zh": "对。"
    },
    {
      "id": 48,
      "start": 163.32,
      "end": 164.8,
      "en": "Their body is still touching the ground.",
      "zh": "他们的身体还在摸着地面。"
    },
    {
      "id": 49,
      "start": 164.8,
      "end": 171.17,
      "en": "Okay, so just imagine if you have a really heavy suitcase, it doesn't have any wheels, you got to drag it across the floor.",
      "zh": "好吧，想象一下，如果你有一个非常重的手提箱，它没有任何轮子，你必须把它拖到地板上。"
    },
    {
      "id": 50,
      "start": 171.44,
      "end": 172.44,
      "en": "Yeah.",
      "zh": "对。"
    },
    {
      "id": 51,
      "start": 172.44,
      "end": 173.44,
      "en": "Right?",
      "zh": "对吧？"
    },
    {
      "id": 52,
      "start": 173.44,
      "end": 174.44,
      "en": "I've been there.",
      "zh": "我也经历过。"
    },
    {
      "id": 53,
      "start": 174.44,
      "end": 175.44,
      "en": "Yeah, it's happened to me too.",
      "zh": "是的，这也发生在我身上。"
