      "end": 532.42,
      "en": "Pretending.",
      "zh": "假装。"
    },
    {
      "id": 237,
      "start": 534.28,
      "end": 535.28,
      "en": "Pretending.",
      "zh": "假装。"
    },
    {
      "id": 238,
      "start": 535.28,
      "end": 536.28,
      "en": "Okay.",
      "zh": "好的。"
    },
    {
      "id": 239,
      "start": 536.28,
      "end": 541.28,
      "en": "So let's listen to her dialogue one more time and then we'll come back and talk some more.",
      "zh": "所以让我们再听一次她的对话，然后我们会回来再谈一些。"
    },
    {
      "id": 240,
      "start": 541.28,
      "end": 545.28,
      "en": "All right.",
      "zh": "好的。"
    },
    {
      "id": 241,
      "start": 551.44,
      "end": 553.2,
      "en": "Drag her over here and help me tie her up.",
      "zh": "把她拖过来，帮我把她绑上。"
    },
    {
      "id": 242,
      "start": 555.12,
      "end": 556.64,
      "en": "I can't believe she fell for it.",
      "zh": "没想到她真上当了。"
    },
    {
      "id": 243,
      "start": 557.12,
      "end": 559.38,
      "en": "She is a lot more gullible than I thought.",
      "zh": "她比我想象的还容易骗。"
    },
    {
      "id": 244,
      "start": 559.72,
      "end": 564.0,
      "en": "Well, you got to admit my acting was brilliant.",
      "zh": "你得承认，我演得太精彩了。"
    },
    {
      "id": 245,
      "start": 564.0,
      "end": 565.0,
      "en": "Whatever.",
      "zh": "随便吧。"
    },
    {
      "id": 246,
      "start": 565.0,
      "end": 566.69,
      "en": "I was the one that convinced her to come.",
      "zh": "我是说服她来的人。"
    },
    {
      "id": 247,
      "start": 568.08,
      "end": 569.56,
      "en": "Look, she's waking up.",
      "zh": "看，她醒过来了。"
    },
    {
      "id": 248,
      "start": 572.04,
      "end": 573.04,
      "en": "What's going on, Ellen?",
      "zh": "艾伦，这是怎么回事？"
    },
    {
      "id": 249,
      "start": 573.04,
      "end": 574.04,
      "en": "What are you doing?",
      "zh": "你在做什么？"
    },
    {
      "id": 250,
      "start": 575.69,
      "end": 577.75,
      "en": "The cat's out of the bag, you witch.",
      "zh": "猫从袋子里出来了，你女巫。"
    },
    {
      "id": 251,
      "start": 578.52,
      "end": 579.53,
      "en": "You can stop pretending now.",
      "zh": "别再装了。"
    },
    {
      "id": 252,
      "start": 579.96,
      "end": 580.39,
      "en": "Yeah, Lois.",
      "zh": "对，露易丝。"
    },
    {
      "id": 253,
      "start": 581.2,
      "end": 582.15,
      "en": "We know who you are.",
      "zh": "我们知道你是谁。"
    },
    {
      "id": 254,
      "start": 582.57,
      "end": 583.83,
      "en": "Now we want some answers.",
      "zh": "现在我们要你说清楚。"
    },
    {
      "id": 255,
      "start": 584.73,
      "end": 585.45,
      "en": "Why are you here?",
      "zh": "你为什么在这里？"
    },
    {
      "id": 256,
      "start": 590.84,
      "end": 604.48,
      "en": "You don't know who you're dealing with.",
      "zh": "你不知道你在和谁打交道。"
    },
    {
      "id": 257,
      "start": 604.48,
      "end": 605.48,
      "en": "You can't stop me.",
      "zh": "你阻止不了我。"
    },
    {
      "id": 258,
      "start": 605.48,
      "end": 624.92,
      "en": "Run!",
      "zh": "快跑！"
    },
    {
      "id": 259,
      "start": 624.92,
      "end": 626.96,
      "en": "Okay so what do you think will happen in part five?",
      "zh": "好吧，你认为第五部分会发生什么？"
    },
    {
      "id": 260,
      "start": 627.48,
      "end": 628.38,
      "en": "I have no idea.",
      "zh": "我完全不知道。"
    },
    {
      "id": 261,
      "start": 630.04,
      "end": 632.02,
      "en": "Well what do you guys think will happen in part five?",
      "zh": "那么你们认为第五部分会发生什么？"
    },
    {
      "id": 262,
      "start": 632.8,
      "end": 636.2,
      "en": "Actually Armand isn't a vampire anymore.",
      "zh": "实际上，阿曼德不再是吸血鬼了。"
    },
    {
      "id": 263,
      "start": 636.2,
      "end": 636.94,
      "en": "But Lois is a witch.",
      "zh": "但露易丝是个女巫。"
    },
    {
      "id": 264,
      "start": 637.2,
      "end": 638.02,
      "en": "But Lois is a witch.",
      "zh": "但露易丝是个女巫。"
    },
    {
      "id": 265,
      "start": 638.42,
      "end": 638.78,
      "en": "Who's Ellen?",
      "zh": "艾伦是谁？"
    },
    {
      "id": 266,
      "start": 639.62,
      "end": 641.56,
      "en": "What sort of twist are we going to see here?",
      "zh": "我们将在这里看到什么样的转折？"
    },
    {
      "id": 267,
      "start": 641.6,
      "end": 642.6,
      "en": "Is she an alien?",
      "zh": "她是外星人吗？"
    },
    {
      "id": 268,
      "start": 642.8,
      "end": 643.3,
      "en": "Oh my God.",
      "zh": "我的天哪。"
    },
    {
      "id": 269,
      "start": 643.76,
      "end": 646.78,
      "en": "We don't know what will happen but you can tell us what you think will happen.",
      "zh": "我们不知道会发生什么，但您可以告诉我们您认为会发生什么。"
    },
    {
      "id": 270,
      "start": 647.16,
      "end": 653.58,
      "en": "Come to our website at EnglishPod.com and leave all your questions and comments and maybe your story ideas.",
      "zh": "访问我们的网站 englishpod.com 并留下您的所有问题和评论，也许是您的故事创意。"
    },
    {
      "id": 271,
      "start": 653.88,
      "end": 658.84,
      "en": "Yes, Marco and I are always around to answer your questions and to respond to your comments.",
      "zh": "是的，Marco 和我总是在身边回答您的问题并回复您的评论。"
    },
    {
      "id": 272,
      "start": 659.16,
      "end": 662.6,
      "en": "So guys, I think we're out of time for today but thanks for listening.",
      "zh": "所以伙计们，我认为我们今天没有时间了，但感谢您的收听。"
    },
    {
      "id": 273,
      "start": 662.6,
      "end": 663.5,
      "en": "And we'll see you next time.",
      "zh": "我们下次再见。"
    },
    {
      "id": 274,
      "start": 663.6,
      "end": 664.6,
      "en": "Goodbye.",
      "zh": "再见。"
    },
    {
      "id": 275,
      "start": 664.6,
      "end": 673.306,
      "en": "Have a great week.",
      "zh": "有一个美好的一周。"
    }
  ],
